      <p class="mt-3 text-[10px] text-[#64748b]">Read-only. Call counters come from <code>user_token_usage</code> and <code>users.usage_*</code>; token figures come from the measured request ledger (<code>requests</code> joined to <code>sessions.user_id</code>) — the same source HakTerm's sidebar reads. Card cost is calculated at <b>1¢ per request</b> for our own records only: it is display math in this page and never deducts tokens, credits, or call caps. Any provider-reported cost is shown separately in the hover detail. Only <code>reserveUsage()</code> writes the counters. Free is a rolling 30-day window, Lite resets on the 1st of each UTC month.</p>
